    <h3>Business Impact</h3>
    <p>By eliminating the time barrier at the register, enrollment jumped immediately. The flow generated <strong>$60M in incremental year-over-year margin</strong> and drove <strong>25,000 new member enrollments every single week</strong>.</p>

    <p>Behind the simple UI was a robust logic framework: we mapped dozens of edge cases to handle duplicate phone numbers, unlinked household accounts, and anti-gaming rules without slowing down checkout speed.</p>

